[[wiki/meta/index|meta]] · [[wiki/meta/digest|Digest]] · [[wiki/meta/recent-activity|Recent]] · [[wiki/meta/skills|Skills]]

Every entry in this wiki is written for a reader who already knows the

corpus. The Reader's Digest is the same finding told to somebody who has

never read anything else here — the same facts, the same numbers, the

same admissions of what is not known, with the machinery taken out. The

EDITION switch in the header is where you read it.

This page is the campaign to write one for every entry.

